- Updated `next.config.ts` to enable `authInterrupts`.
- Created `app/admin/page.tsx` with admin check logic.
- Created `app/forbidden.tsx` with custom UI for 403 errors.

I'll perform one last check on `app/lib/auth.ts` just to be absolutely sure about the export.
